ck Hammer"},"message":"feat(sia-video-source): iPhone MSE implementation support and device-too-old reporting\n\nAdds an MSE implementation probe (mse-runtime.ts) that resolves the runtime\nMediaSource variant: standard, ManagedMediaSource (iPhone Safari 17.1+),\nlegacy WebKitMediaSource prefix, or none.\n\nManaged runtimes construct an MMS in the worker when allowed, and the element\ngets disableRemotePlayback = true before every src/srcObject attach, as Safari\nrequires for sourceopen. startstreaming/endstreaming forward as diagnostics.\n\nRuntimes with no usable MSE fail fast through a new device wire kind that maps\nto MEDIA_ERR_SRC_NOT_SUPPORTED with an update-your-device message on the v10\nerror channel. PlaybackCapabilities gains mseImpl() and mseSupported consults\nthe resolved implementation. ADR 0010 documents the matrix.","tree":{"sha":"facb1cee145b2b60392e49d8c69e5cc3ab68d4a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LumeWeb/web/git/trees/facb1cee145b2b60392e49d8c69e5cc3ab68d4a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LumeWeb/web/git/commits/d6e9f1fae8d809d945dd12b0a85e67c8207dc511","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10647?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pcfreak30","id":10647,"login":"pcfreak30","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcfreak30/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su