b.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/267f08d6e3e1767a66aa8f755fa2bf21a2c4be5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T21:26:46Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T21:26:46Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"fix(builder): surface tsconfig read and parse errors\n\ngetCompilerOptions swallowed every tsconfig error and returned an\nempty/partial options object: a missing file, malformed JSON, a broken\n`extends` target, or an invalid option value all yielded a build with\ndropped strict/lib/etc., quietly degrading the emitted types.\n\nNow both readConfigFile and parseJsonConfigFileContent diagnostics are\nsurfaced as a BuilderError with the underlying message. The benign\n\"No inputs were found\" (TS18003) diagnostic is ignored, since the\nbuilder passes entry files to the program itself. `extends` resolution\nwas already correct and is unchanged.\n\nAdds a getCompilerOptions test suite: override precedence, extends\ninheritance, the TS18003 exemption, and the error paths.","tree":{"sha":"f75a46fe61ea800a426ee41c84628eed12850545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/trees/f75a46fe61ea800a426ee41c84628eed12850545"},"url":"https://api.g