lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/1c47ac18b7b0b3bac4b0730c10fb4247f050884c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:41:59Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:41:59Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"feat(fetcher): TLS, auth headers, stale-if-error and ETag revalidation\n\n- TLS options (ca/cert/key/pfx/passphrase/rejectUnauthorized) for remotes\n  behind mutual TLS or an internal CA, across the programmatic API, CLI\n  and the LS plugin (cert paths in tsconfig resolved and read to buffers)\n- custom request headers, with ${VAR} env substitution in tsconfig and\n  credential headers dropped on cross-origin redirects\n- stale-if-error: fall back to an expired cached copy with a warning when\n  the server is unreachable (disabled by fetch --force)\n- conditional revalidation: send If-None-Match from the stored ETag and\n  refresh the cache TTL on 304 without re-downloading\n- fetch remotes in parallel, expose maxRedirects, follow 303, reject\n  empty/HTML responses instead of caching them\n- plugin background refresh reuses the fetcher pipeline (fetchOne) with\n  retries and per-remote error isolation",