rved as-is.\n\nAdd cjs-patterns example covering both external and internal\nimport = require usage.","tree":{"sha":"b6ab9426bab6699d71e94e11f8e2aad8b3288aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/trees/b6ab9426bab6699d71e94e11f8e2aad8b3288aee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/commits/cd0b5bb68e0602044df9a65fe9bd6c71f5cf514a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commit/cd0b5bb68e0602044df9a65fe9bd6c71f5cf514a","node_id":"C_kwDOLw3wndoAKGNkMGI1YmI2OGUwNjAyMDQ0ZGY5YTY1ZmU5YmQ2YzcxZjVjZjUxNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commit/3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12","sha":"3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12"}],"sha":"cd0b5bb68e0602044df9a65fe9bd6c71f5cf514a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/cd0b5bb68e0602044df9a65fe9bd6c71f5cf514a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T13:00:35Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T02:54:12Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"fix: skip alias collection for external module imports\n\ncollectAliases() was called before the isExternalLibraryImport check,\ncausing aliased imports from external modules (e.g. node:buffer,\nnode:events) to be resolved to their original names. This made\ntranspileDeclaration() drop the import as \"unused\", leaving broken\ntype references in the output.\n\nMove collectAliases() after the external library guard so aliases are\nonly collected for internal (inlined) modules.\n\nAdd comprehensive example covering aliased imports from both internal\nand external modules.","tree":{"sha":"f5564f054baf9ba39a3f41c74b67a2bf01d98df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/trees/f5564f054baf9ba39a3f41c74b67a2bf01d98df2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/commits/3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commit/3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12","node_id":"C_kwDOLw3wndoAKDNmN2M4Mjc1YTcyYTliNzBmNGU0ZTQxOWYzMTZjOTdjNjM2MTlkMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commit/9dc02df347bd48078c544df653970ea0bfc73d02","sha":"9dc02df347bd48078c544df653970ea0bfc73d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/9dc02df347bd48078c544df653970ea0bfc73d02"}],"sha":"3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/3f7c8275a72a9b70f4e4e419f316c97c63619d12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arkhipovdenis","id":36173209,"login":"arkhipovdenis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTczMjA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/commits/9dc02df347bd48078c544df653970ea0bfc73d02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-23T11:02:19Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T10:51:46Z","email":"themontanyes@yandex.ru","name":"Denis Arkhipov"},"message":"feat!: release v2.0.0 - complete rewrite with improved performance and API\n\nMajor architectural redesign focused on performance, tree-shaking, and developer experience.\n\n- 3-5x faster build times through shared caches and optimized AST processing\n- Tree-shaking support for smaller output bundles\n- Single-pass AST transformation\n- Efficient private member filtering\n\n- Simplified entries API: tuple → object format\n- Changed from compiler() to build() function\n- Async API with Promise support\n- Better TypeScript type inference and autocomplete\n\n- Namespace variant support (declare namespace vs declare module)\n- Extended TypeScript construct coverage:\n  * Conditional, mapped, and template literal types\n  * Recursive types and generic constraints\n  * Private fields (TypeScript private and JS #field)\n  * Static and async modifiers\n- Custom output formatting function\n- Additional declarations support\n\n- Migrated to kebab-case naming convention\n- Consolidated packages/lib into packages/builder\n- Improved error handling with structured error classes\n- Strict TypeScript compliance\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Major API redesign\n\n- Import path: ''ts-remote/compiler'' → ''ts-remote/builder''\n- Function: compiler() → build() (now async)\n- Config: moduleList object → entries array\n- Entry format: [''name'', { filename }] → { name, filename, variant }\n- Removed: loader package (moved to separate package)\n\nBefore (v1.x):\n```typescript\nimport { compiler } from ''ts-remote/compiler'';\n\ncompiler({\n  moduleList: {\n    ''my-app'': ''./src/index.ts'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\nAfter (v2.0):\n```typescript\nimport build from ''ts-remote/builder'';\n\nawait build({\n  entries: [\n    { name: ''my-app'', filename: ''./src/index.ts'' },\n  ],\n});\n```\n\nSee CHANGELOG.md and MIGRATION.md for full details.","tree":{"sha":"336743f9adc0e10fbbf0c837298df1a34eac9405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/trees/336743f9adc0e10fbbf0c837298df1a34eac9405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arkhipovdenis/ts-remote/git/commits/9dc02df347bd48078c544df653970ea0bfc73d02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36173209?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkhipovdenis/following{/other_user}","gis