tps://api.github.com/users/angonz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angonz","id":15031867,"login":"angonz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDMxODY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aulasneo/frontend-app-panorama/commits/c0a7ea9f013edbbed4d9b7350ea3b3e94d49fe8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:40:43Z","email":"andres@aulasneo.com","name":"Andrés González"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T00:40:43Z","email":"andres@aulasneo.com","name":"Andrés González"},"message":"fix: resolve Panorama embedding lifecycle and tab layout issues\n\nAnchor the tab menu to its sidebar instead of applying viewport offsets\ninside the positioned dashboard. Keep the dashboard as the containing\nblock for the loading overlay. Use stable dashboard names for tab keys\nand element IDs so repeated labels preserve DOM identity on reorder.\nDerive menu entries directly from the response to clear stale entries\nwhen the dashboard list becomes empty.\n\nClear the shared loader when an active Studio load is cancelled, since\nthe cancelled request skips its finally reset. Clear Home mode before\nfetching and refetch when the authenticated user changes, preventing the\nprevious mode from remaining visible during navigation or session changes.\nKeep cancellation guards so late responses cannot replace current state.\n\nConfigure React''s act environment once in the shared Jest setup instead\nof mutating it inside individual tests. Match default API mocks against\nfull URLs and assert the exact role, dashboard, Studio and Home endpoints.\nAdd regression coverage for Home revisits, LMS changes, logout/login,\nstale Home responses, cancellation at three Studio initialization stages,\nand stable tab identity when dashboard labels repeat.\n\nAdd Panorama-specific context and deployment actions to the archived AWS\nHealth notice, including canonical user ARN and IAM policy review, positive\nand negative embedding checks, and the passed September 16 deadline.\nDistinguish backend and provider responsibilities from frontend behavior,\nstate that deployed policies remain unverified, link the document from\nREADME, and correct the HTML-escaped separator in the AWS Health URL.\n\nUpdate validation notes: the baseline was 22 tests including parameterized\ncases, and the revised suite passes 31 tests across two suites on Node 24.\nLint and production build pass. A browser fixture verifies menu alignment\nat 63px and 110px header heights and dashboard overlay containment.\nDocument the build size warnings, unset optional PARAGON_THEME_URLS, and\nremaining deployed browser and AWS authorization verification requirements.","tree":{"sha":"4dd12a2a83123fee257885de2c069efec0463d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aulasneo/frontend-app-panorama/git/trees/4dd12a2a83123fee257885de2c069efec0463d43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aulasneo/frontend-app-panorama/git/commits/c0a7ea9f013edbbed4d9b7350ea3b3e94d49fe8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15031867?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/