"feat(phase10.5-10.7): add super app, backend integration, and AI/ML mobile tracks\n\n- Add Phase 10.5 Super App track with Melos, micro-frontend architecture, feature flags, and module communication demos\n- Add Phase 10.6 Backend Integration track with GraphQL, gRPC, Supabase advanced, and REST API patterns\n- Add Phase 10.7 AI/ML Mobile track with TFLite, ML Kit, on-device LLM, and AI pattern implementations\n- Include mini projects: Super App Shell (3-module adaptive navigation), Realtime Chat (Supabase + optimistic UI), and Smart Scanner (ML Kit + TFLite expense classifier)\n- Update README with completion status and run commands for all three new tracks\n- Complete Phase 10 specialization with all 7 tracks now ready for production use","tree":{"sha":"ab213c2dddb9eaa987ac8a1ac54e1d2dfc5858dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanzankazu/Kanzan_Learn_Flutter/git/trees/ab213c2dddb9eaa987ac8a1ac54e1d2dfc5858dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanzankazu/Kanzan_Learn_Flutter/git/commits/b483c9ccd3a3a61b6fa060d4ab9842be5390b472","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26266639?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kanzankazu","id":26266639,"login":"kanzankazu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjY2NjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith