id, and SliverPersistentHeader\n- Add Advanced Animation demo with AnimationController, Tween, CurvedAnimation, and stagger effects\n- Add Platform Channels demo with MethodChannel and EventChannel examples\n- Add Responsive & Adaptive design demo for multi-screen support\n- Add Accessibility demo covering semantics, contrast, and screen reader support\n- Add Internationalization demo with localization and language switching\n- Create main_phase6.dart entry point for all Phase 6 topics\n- Update README with Phase 6 topics, status, and running instructions\n- Reorder Phase 4 and Phase 5 documentation in README for better structure\n- Update Phase 6 status from \"Coming Soon\" to \"Ready\"\n- Update Gradle wrapper and Android settings for dependency compatibility\n- Add donation messaging and coffee link to README footer","tree":{"sha":"200ffb7a46fc25601bb8ecd71777d70203d21ff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanzankazu/Kanzan_Learn_Flutter/git/trees/200ffb7a46fc25601bb8ecd71777d70203d21ff4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanzankazu/Kanzan_Learn_Flutter/git/commits/0ab95deb45874a28ca84338c5632001cea6bdf93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26266639?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kanzankazu","id":26266639,"login":"kanzankazu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MjY2NjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kanzankazu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co