00512,"login":"Lokmali","node_id":"U_kgDOC19igA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lokmali","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/near-social-js/commits/98018976df1f31ec8fb4a65a7c92eb059a4cfa55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-12T03:31:18Z","email":"malilokesh000@gmail.com","name":"Lokesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-12T03:31:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"implement social features (comments, reposts, unlike, feeds, notifications, poke) (#57)\n\n* feat: enhance Post structure to match NEAR Social''s expected format\n\n- Update Post interface with text, type (optional, defaults to ''md''), and image fields\n- Update createPost to store { text, type } in post/main (JSON stringified)\n- createPost indexes to index/post with key ''main'' and value { type: ''md'' }\n- Add tests for post structure verification\n- Update demo UI to use new Post structure\n- Mark Task 3 as complete in TASKS.md\n\n* feat: add comments feature for posts\n\n- Add Comment and CommentItem interfaces\n- Add createComment(signerId, { item, text, image? }) method\n- Comment stored at {signerId}/post/comment as JSON with { item, text, type }\n- Comment indexed at index/comment with key = item, value = { type: ''md'' }\n- Add getComments(item) method to retrieve comments for a post\n- Export Comment and CommentItem types from index\n- Add tests for comment creation and retrieval\n- Update demo UI with createComment and getComments method cards\n- Mark Task 4 as complete in TASKS.md\n\n* feat: implement social features (comments, repost, unlike, feeds, notifications, poke)\n\n* Fix notify indexing; update sandbox tests; stabilize demo UI\n\n* Fix notify indexing; update sandbox tests\n\n* Fix sandbox social tests (keys + testItem init)\n\n* fix: avoid undefined notify target and ensure sandbox accounts have keys\n\n* test: bump sandbox storage deposit + account registration\n\n* test: increase vitest hook timeouts for sandbox + fix unfollow assertion\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>\nCo-authored-by: lokmali <lokmali@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"86d40fc4804e922eebaef373b8c0b935db5a0962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/near-social-js/git/trees/86d40fc4804e922eebaef373b8c0b935db5a0962"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/near-social-js/git/commits/98018976df1f31ec8fb4a65a7c92eb059a4cfa55","verification":{"payload":"tree 86d40fc4804e922eebaef373b8c0b935db5a0962\nparent 90056dcad0c358e4550ecc61ab5a53b87202b928\nauthor Lokesh <malilokesh000@gmail.com> 1768188678 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768188678 -0700\n\nimplement social features (comments, reposts, unlike, feeds, notifications, poke) (#57)\n\n* feat: enhance Post structure to match NEAR Social''s expected format\n\n- Update Post interface with text, type (optional, defaults to ''md''), and image fields\n- Update createPost to store { text, type } in post/main (JSON stringified)\n- createPost indexes to index/post with key ''main'' and value { type: ''md'' }\n- Add tests for post structure verification\n- Update demo UI to use new Post structure\n- Mark Task 3 as complete in TASKS.md\n\n* feat: add comments feature for posts\n\n- Add Comment and CommentItem interfaces\n- Add createComment(signerId, { item, text, image? }) method\n- Comment stored at {signerId}/post/comment as JSON with { item, text, type }\n- Comment indexed at index/comment with key = item, value = { type: ''md'' }\n- Add getComments(item) method to retrieve comments for a post\n- Export Comment and CommentItem types from index\n- Add tests for comment creation and retrieval\n- Update demo UI with createComment and getComments method cards\n- Mark Task 4 as complete in TASKS.md\n\n* feat: implement social features (comments, repost, unlike, feeds, notifications, poke)\n\n* Fix notify indexing; update sandbox tests; stabilize demo UI\n\n* Fix notify indexing; update sandbox tests\n\n* Fix sandbox social tests (keys + testItem init)\n\n* fix: avoid undefined notify target and ensure sandbox accounts have keys\n\n* test: bump sandbox storage deposit + account registration\n\n* test: increase vitest hook timeouts for sandbox + fix unfollow assertion\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com>\nCo-authored-by: lokmali <lokmali@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpZGsGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArg4QABnNW3JQhyjnUKVWEUR5yZ9R\nFNWrC4HVBofKPp0Sf1A7Y/Uw1JM5drysn20cGsBShSTIMice52fM/7wOuxtNj9hS\nvvW+nO2AzNXRY1jNq1jLNJjRxbvvoZh9TC8EA6Y0YvdHD2KN/+sKTQKm67tlFy98\nyY+dDIhPXyws5dF91wUatTlqSLL2J9SqVVPyqNOklx8MW7LX45XNXR1QDLK7W3XW\n7+EpHSIMPJqpLfYY4HEc4Afwy7mB2oioVRG2Vcf16BAZ5orQYo4R21GRwGERri0q\nMzRJA6i34Vm9k95o4xArm3oqRU8fiNnQF9gs3DaGPjXYDr+KULY92nBsmfnTe251\n4metFhVf0LePRvhz5AHkAMG+dc5NOGIoEeWISpxLiRSoeTG50BMZ2f+6GjnlSV9p\nw/FqvWfvoLvkNjfUslKR5c9rCp/YlUmv/GMh7gBLQGEknd6TDhmqDjo2EOXOusO3\nvxnQ/8HcGGcuR121ri9l84TZar3e+5odHIquUceAdMD8yQtsiSvX2/cfcHuLpFmd\n1DaQMZoT1V70c9NhDP/6valD4ta3cpORtleeOhTKKvHy72pXC5/ZkXYinMXX4x5t\nhlsQSyGmlnSyWYuEae5nyoogYhhxH9rJNOXZWl937vU+Hy0l/oU8yFHO/4fh6Wqa\n1zCqqGODQBVY4IHY0URv\n=Zka+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-12T03:31:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/follo